+@startuml
+!theme plain
+title TASK-260715-1pn983 — reconnect and rekey reservations
+hide empty description
+state "Transport current" as Current #lightgreen
+state "Lane KEX reserved" as KEXReserved #lightblue
+state "Lane KEX active" as KEXActive #lightyellow
+state "Replacement reserved" as ReplacementReserved #lightblue
+state "Old released" as OldReleased #orange
+state "Replacement connecting" as ReplacementConnecting #lightyellow
+state "Replacement current" as ReplacementCurrent #lightgreen
+state "Lane failed" as LaneFailed #pink
+state "Explicit stop" as ExplicitStop #lightgray
+[*] --> Current
+Current --> KEXReserved : lane admission pre-reserves KEX bytes
+KEXReserved --> KEXActive : trigger / pause new channels
+KEXActive --> Current : success / release old keys and scratch
+KEXActive --> LaneFailed : failure / fail lane channels once
+LaneFailed --> ReplacementReserved : replacement fits ledger + overlap
+Current --> ReplacementReserved : reconnect requested and overlap fits
+ReplacementReserved --> ReplacementConnecting : Normal/Soft/Pressure
+ReplacementConnecting --> ReplacementCurrent : capability usable / ordered old release
+ReplacementReserved --> OldReleased : Critical / cancel new start
+ReplacementConnecting --> OldReleased : Critical / cancel and clean new
+Current --> OldReleased : Critical reconnect / close old first
+OldReleased --> ReplacementConnecting : critical bootstrap reservation fits
+ReplacementReserved --> ExplicitStop : reservation refused, no safe continuity
+OldReleased --> ExplicitStop : bootstrap cannot fit/finish by deadline
+LaneFailed --> ExplicitStop : terminal cause or replacement exhausted
+ExplicitStop --> [*] : invalidate generations and reconcile cleanup
+note bottom of KEXActive
+Existing flows stay pinned.
+No replay, migration, or trigger side queue.
+end note
+note bottom of ReplacementReserved
+Constructor is unreachable until
+reservation succeeds atomically.
+end note
+@enduml
